{
  "id": "2KI.25",
  "number": "25",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Kua̱R 25",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pɛ̈ɛ̈n Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dhid-ki-yaa rɔ luɔ̱c kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn. ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ cäŋ kä wäl kä pay wäl kɛ bäŋuan runi ruecdɛ cu Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm mak kɛ rɛmdɛ kɛɛliw, kä cuɛ jɛ go̱l. Kä cukɛ jɛ ta̱th päny mi göl kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua wec go̱l amäni wäl kɛl runi ruecä kua̱r ni Dhid-ki-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ bäŋuan ni̱ni kɛ ŋuaan päthni, cu buɔth di̱t rɛy wec, kä cuɛ thil mi cam naathɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua päny wec to̱l. Cu kuäär kɛnɛ rɛm kɛɛliw rɔ̱ bar kɛ wäär kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p in te kam pa̱nyni da̱ŋ rɛw gekä kakä kua̱r, kä ci ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn wec go̱l. Kä cukɛ wä kɛ kui̱ lo̱o̱lä Jɔr-dɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu rɛm ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kuäär guɔ̱ɔ̱r mäni mëë ca jɛ cop rɛy tɔ̱ɔ̱rä Jɛ-ri-ko. Kä cua rɛmdɛ däkä dɔɔr gekädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ kuäär käp, kä cua jɛ nöŋ kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kä Rib-laa, kä cuɛ jɛ kum kɛ Lia̱a̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua gat Dhid-ki-yaa näk ni nhiamdɛ, kä cua wäŋkɛ lööl raar, kä cua jɛ pua̱t kɛ kuatni, kä cua jɛ naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Däk luaak Kuɔth Nhial",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ kä bärɔw kä pay dhieec (min la wäl bäŋuan runi ruecä Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn). Cu Nɛ-bu-dhar-dan raan läätdä kua̱r Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, min la bo̱o̱th yiëëni ben kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ luak Kuɔth Nhial kɛnɛ duel kua̱r kɛ ti̱ec Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm diaal waŋ. Kɛn ti̱ec diaal tin di̱t cuɛ kɛ waŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu rɛm Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ni kɛɛliw in te kɛɛl kɛ bo̱o̱th yiëëni, päny in go̱l Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm da̱k piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu duɔth nɛɛni tëë ci duɔth rɛy wec, kɛnɛ duɔth nɛɛni diaal tëë ci wä kä kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn cu Nɛ-bu-dhar-dan bo̱o̱th yiëëni kɛ naŋ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu bo̱o̱th yiëëni ɛ tha̱a̱ŋ nɛɛni tin la can ba̱ny piny kɛ ɣöö ba ka̱a̱k lɔ̱ɔ̱ pith.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn riäk yieethä min do̱l in te luaak Kuɔth Nhial, kɛnɛ dhaar puɔɔkä tiath, kä cukɛ yiëëth in do̱l kap kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱k, kɛnɛ liir, kɛ kueenyni maac, kɛ kuak yieethä min do̱l diaal tin lät kɛ naath rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial ka̱n, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu mäni kɔ̱ɔ̱li maac, kɛnɛ took. Kä cuɛ tin diaal tin la da̱a̱p kɛnɛ tin la ciɛk in bo̱r ka̱n bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ yiëëth in do̱l täth ni dhaar puɔɔkä kɛnɛ wääthni da̱ŋ rɛw, kɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ tëë ci Thɔ-lo-mon kɛ lät ni luak Kuɔth Nhial a ti ca luäŋ kɛ thëm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bär wääthä kɛl ɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ wäl bädäk, kä te wi̱cdɛ kɛ kum yieethä min do̱l. Kä bär kumä ɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. Kä ca kɛt ce̱tkɛ jɔk jua̱a̱th, kä ca win kɛɛliw kɛ yiëëth in do̱l. Kä cua jɛn ta̱a̱ wääthä min dɔ̱ŋ ɛ nɔ bä ca kɛt ce̱tkɛ jɔk jua̱a̱th.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pɛc ji̱ Juda kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bo̱o̱th yiëëni bo̱o̱th palä min di̱i̱t ni Thɛ-ra-yaa, kɛnɛ bo̱o̱th palä min rɛwdɛ ni Dhɛ-pɛ̈n-yaa, kɛ gueec thuɔk kal da̱ŋ diɔ̱k naŋ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ raan kɔar kua̱r min la naath ɛ bo̱o̱th ko̱o̱r, kɛnɛ ji̱ yiën kua̱r da̱ŋ dhieec ti te rɛy wec, kɛ bolith bo̱o̱thä rɛ̈m min la naath a car, kɛ nɛy ti jiɛn bäkɛl ti kɔ̱ŋ ti ca jek rɛy wi̱c naŋ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Nɛ-bu-dhar-dan kɛn diaal naŋ, cuɛ kɛ nöŋ kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kä Rib-laa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛ näk kä Rib-laa muun Ä-math. Inɔ cua ji̱ Juda naŋ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c muundiɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rueec Juda ni Gɛ-dɛ̈l-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn Gɛ-dɛ̈l-yaa gat Ä-ɣi-kam, gat Ca-pan kuany ala rueec nɛɛni tëë cɛ ba̱ny kä Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca jɛ liŋ ɛ bööth rɛmni diaal kɛ nɛɛkiɛn ɛn ɣöö ci kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn Gɛ-dɛ̈l-yaa kuany ala rueec, cukɛ ben kä Gɛ-dɛ̈l-yaa kɛ nɛɛkiɛn kä Midh-pa, I-ca-mel gat Nɛ-thɛ̈n-yaa, kɛ Yo-ɣa-nan gat Ka-re-ɛ̈k, kɛ Thɛ-ra-yaa gat Tɛ̈n-ɣu-mɛth raan Nɛ-to-path, kɛ Yɛ̈-ä-dhɛ̈n-yaa min la gat ran Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Gɛ-dɛ̈l-yaa rɔ ya̱ckɛ wëë i̱, “/Cuarɛ dual kɛ bööth ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn. Cieŋɛ wec, kä la̱tdɛ kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ikä, bi gɔaa ni jɛn kɛ yɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö kɛ bärɔw päthni, cu I-ca-mel gat Nɛ-thɛ̈n-yaa, gat Ɛli-cama raan thuɔk duëël kuäärä, ben kɛ nɛy da̱ŋ wäl, cuɛ Gɛ-dɛ̈l-yaa näk kɛnɛ ji̱ Juda, kɛ ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn tëë te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ kä Midh-pa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal amäni gaat, kɛ bööth rɛmni rɔ bar kä I-jëp. Kɛ ɣöö dualkɛ kɛ ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luɔ̱ny Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin duëël yieenä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ kä jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bärɔw kä pay wäl rɛw kɛ ruɔ̱n jiɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ bärɔw mëë pɛckɛ Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin kuäär Juda, mëë took Ɛ-wil-mɛ-ro-dɛ̈k kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kuäär. Cuɛ Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin kuäär Juda lony duëël yieenä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruac agɔaa kɛ jɛ, kä cuɛ ka̱m kɔm mi leny kɔamni kua̱ri tin te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ ni wen kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin bieyni duëël yieenä woc. Kä cuɛ la mi̱thɛ kɛɛl kɛ kuäär ni ciaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä la kuäär jɛ a moc yio̱w ni ciaŋ, ce̱tnikɛ ni̱n teekädɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
